{"suttaId":"tha-ap432","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[491,535],"vripara":"157"},"segments":{"tha-ap432:0.3":"Soṇṇakontarikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap432:1.1":"“Manobhāvaniyaṃ buddhaṃ, attadantaṃ samāhitaṃ;","tha-ap432:1.3":"Iriyamānaṃ brahmapathe, cittavūpasame rataṃ.","tha-ap432:2.1":"“Nittiṇṇaoghaṃ sambuddhaṃ, jhāyiṃ jhānarataṃ muniṃ;","tha-ap432:2.3":"Upatitthaṃ samāpannaṃ, indivaradalappabhaṃ.","tha-ap432:3.1":"“Alābunodakaṃ gayha, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ upāgamiṃ;","tha-ap432:3.3":"Buddhassa pāde dhovitvā, alābukamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap432:4.1":"“Āṇāpesi ca sambuddho, padumuttaranāmako;","tha-ap432:4.3":"‘Iminā dakamāhatvā, pādamūle ṭhapehi me’.","tha-ap432:5.1":"“Sādhūtihaṃ paṭissutvā, satthugāravatāya ca;","tha-ap432:5.3":"Dakaṃ alābunāhatvā, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ upāgamiṃ.","tha-ap432:6.1":"“Anumodi mahāvīro, cittaṃ nibbāpayaṃ mama;","tha-ap432:6.3":"‘Iminālābudānena, saṅkappo te samijjhatu’.","tha-ap432:7.1":"“Pannarasesu kappesu, devaloke ramiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap432:7.3":"Tiṃsatikkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap432:8.1":"“Divā vā yadi vā rattiṃ, caṅkamantassa tiṭṭhato;","tha-ap432:8.3":"Sovaṇṇaṃ kontaraṃ gayha, tiṭṭhate purato mama.","tha-ap432:9.1":"“Buddhassa datvānalābuṃ, labhāmi soṇṇakontaraṃ;","tha-ap432:9.3":"Appakampi kataṃ kāraṃ, vipulaṃ hoti tādisu.","tha-ap432:10.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃlābumadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap432:10.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, alābussa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap432:11.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap432:12.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap432:13.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap432:14.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā soṇṇakontariko thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap432:15.1":"Soṇṇakontarikattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap432:16.1":"Sakiṃsammajjakavaggo tecattālīsamo.","tha-ap432:17.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap432:18.1":"Sakiṃsammajjako thero, ekadussī ekāsanī;","tha-ap432:18.3":"Kadambakoraṇḍakado, ghatassavanikopi ca.","tha-ap432:19.1":"Sucintiko kiṅkaṇiko, soṇṇakontarikopi ca;","tha-ap432:19.3":"Ekagāthāsatañcettha, ekasattatimeva ca."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
